{"sha": "20f7408f366dd6750ff6bb640a2f11eb26842055a66ec8ee7e907601ce3bc5c7", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:sinusoidal-impedance} 章 --- 正弦稳态与阻抗}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:1}", "$\\underline U = 5\\eu^{j\\pi/3} = 2.5 + 4.33j$ (V)。$3\\cos\\omega t +", "4\\sin\\omega t$：$3 + 4\\eu^{-j\\pi/2} = 3 - 4j$，模为 $5$，辐角为", "$-\\arctan(4/3) = \\qty{-0.927}{rad}$，故为 $5\\cos(\\omega t - 0.927)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:2}", "$R$：两处均为 \\qty{100}{\\ohm}。$L\\omega$：\\qty{31.4}{\\ohm}（\\qty{50}{Hz}），", "\\qty{628}{\\ohm}（\\qty{1}{kHz}）。$1/C\\omega$：\\qty{318}{\\ohm}，\\qty{15.9}{\\ohm}。", "\\qty{50}{Hz} 时的串联 $RL$：$\\abs{\\underline Z} = \\sqrt{100^2 + 31.4^2} =", "\\qty{105}{\\ohm}$，相位 $\\arctan(0.314) = 17^\\circ$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:3}", "$U = 230\\sqrt2 = \\qty{325}{V}$。$I_{\\mathrm{rms}} = 2000/230 = \\qty{8.7}{A}$，", "峰值为 \\qty{12.3}{A}。由方均根值的定义，$\\langle Ri^2\\rangle = R\\langle i^2\\rangle =", "RI_{\\mathrm{rms}}^2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:4}", "$f_0 = 1/(2\\pi\\sqrt{LC}) = \\qty{5.03}{kHz}$；$Q = \\sqrt{L/C}/R = 3.16$；", "$\\Delta f = f_0/Q = \\qty{1.6}{kHz}$；$I_{\\max} = E/R = \\qty{10}{mA}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:5}", "比值为 $1/\\sqrt2$，出现于 $\\omega = 1/RC$ 时：$f_c = 1/(2\\pi RC) = \\qty{1.0}{kHz}$。在", "\\qty{1.0}{kHz} 处：比值为 $0.71$，相位为 $-45^\\circ$。在 \\qty{10}{kHz} 处：", "$RC\\omega = 10$，比值为 $1/\\sqrt{101} = 0.10$，相位为 $-84^\\circ$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:6}", "$\\underline Z = 100 + j(250 - 100) = 100 + 150j$：$Z = \\qty{180}{\\ohm}$，", "$\\arg = 56^\\circ$。$I = 1.0/180 = \\qty{5.6}{mA}$，滞后于电源 $56^\\circ$。", "$U_R = \\qty{0.56}{V}$，$U_L = \\qty{1.39}{V}$，$U_C = \\qty{0.56}{V}$；", "相量图中：$U_R$ 沿 $I$ 方向，$U_L$ 向上，$U_C$ 向下，合成为 \\qty{1.0}{V}。", "$L\\omega > 1/C\\omega$：处于共振频率以上（感性）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:7}", "$f_0 = 1/(2\\pi\\sqrt{LC})$：\\qty{50}{pF} 时为 \\qty{1.59}{MHz}，\\qty{500}{pF} 时为", "\\qty{0.50}{MHz}。在 \\qty{1.00}{MHz} 处：$C = 1/(4\\pi^2f_0^2L) = \\qty{127}{pF}$。", "$\\Delta f = \\qty{10}{kHz}$。电台位于 \\qty{1.009}{MHz}：$x = 1.009$，", "$Q(x - 1/x) = 1.8$，比值为 $1/\\sqrt{1 + 3.2} = 0.49$。电容器电压为", "$QE = \\qty{1.0}{mV}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:8}", "$Q(x - 1/x) = \\pm1 \\Leftrightarrow x^2 \\mp x/Q - 1 = 0$；正根为", "$x_{1,2} = \\mp 1/2Q + \\sqrt{1 + 1/4Q^2}$。二者之差为 $1/Q$，故", "$\\Delta\\omega = \\omega_0/Q$；乘积为 $(1 + 1/4Q^2) - 1/4Q^2 = 1$，故", "$\\omega_1\\omega_2 = \\omega_0^2$（通带在对数刻度上对称）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:9}", "$I = P/(U\\cos\\varphi) = 2000/(230 \\times 0.70) = \\qty{12.4}{A}$。无功", "功率为 $P\\tan\\varphi = 2000 \\times 1.02 = \\qty{2.0}{kvar}$。$C = 2040/(314", "\\times 230^2) = \\qty{123}{\\micro F}$。补偿后电流为 $2000/230 = \\qty{8.7}{A}$。", "损耗：补偿前为 $0.50 \\times 12.4^2 = \\qty{77}{W}$，补偿后为 $0.50 \\times 8.7^2 =", "\\qty{38}{W}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:10}", "$\\underline Y = 1/R + j(C\\omega - 1/L\\omega)$；$\\underline U = \\underline I/", "\\underline Y$ 在电纳为零时最大，即在 $\\omega_0$ 处，此时 $U = RI$。半功率点满足", "$\\abs{C\\omega - 1/L\\omega} = 1/R$，即", "$RC\\omega_0(x - 1/x) = \\pm1$：$\\Delta\\omega = \\omega_0/(RC\\omega_0) = 1/RC$，", "$Q = RC\\omega_0 = R\\sqrt{C/L}$。数值：$\\omega_0 = \\qty{1.0e6}{rad/s}$", "（$f_0 = \\qty{159}{kHz}$），$Q = 10^4\\sqrt{10^{-6}} = 10$，$\\Delta f =", "\\qty{16}{kHz}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:11}", "$U_C = I/C\\omega = E/[C\\omega\\sqrt{R^2 + (L\\omega - 1/C\\omega)^2}]$；", "将根号内乘以 $C\\omega$：$\\sqrt{(RC\\omega)^2 + (LC\\omega^2 - 1)^2} =", "\\sqrt{x^2/Q^2 + (1 - x^2)^2}$。令 $s = x^2$，则 $(1 - s)^2 + s/Q^2$ 在", "$s = 1 - 1/2Q^2$（若该值为正）时取最小值 $1/Q^2 - 1/4Q^4$，故", "$U_{C,\\max} = QE/\\sqrt{1 - 1/4Q^2}$。$Q = 3.16$ 时：$x_r = 0.975$，", "$U_{C,\\max} = 3.2E$。当 $Q < 1/\\sqrt2$ 时，最小值位于 $s = 0$，$U_C$", "从 $E$ 起单调下降，无峰值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:12}", "共振时 $i = I\\cos\\omega_0 t$，$u_C = (I/C\\omega_0)\\sin\\omega_0 t$，", "利用 $1/C\\omega_0^2 = L$，", "\\[", "\\tfrac12 Li^2 + \\tfrac12 Cu_C^2 = \\tfrac12 LI^2\\cos^2\\omega_0 t", "+ \\tfrac12 LI^2\\sin^2\\omega_0 t = \\tfrac12 LI^2 .", "\\]", "每个周期耗散：$\\tfrac12 RI^2T$。比值 $\\times 2\\pi$：$2\\pi L/(RT)", "= L\\omega_0/R = Q$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\underline Z = R + j(L\\omega - 1/C\\omega)$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\underline I = E/\\underline Z$；$I = E/\\sqrt{R^2 + (L\\omega -", "1/C\\omega)^2}$；$\\varphi_i = -\\arctan[(L\\omega - 1/C\\omega)/R]$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 电抗在 $\\omega_0 = 1/\\sqrt{LC}$ 处为零：$I_{\\max}", "= E/R$，$\\varphi_i = 0$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $C = 1/(4\\pi^2f_0^2L) = \\qty{127}{pF}$；$L\\omega_0 = 2\\times10^{-4}", "\\times 6.28\\times10^6 = \\qty{1257}{\\ohm}$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $Q = 1257/12.6 = 100$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $L\\omega - 1/C\\omega = L\\omega_0(x - 1/x)$，除以 $R$。", ""]}